In any organizational initiative, not all stakeholders are created equal. The Free Stakeholder Map Matrix (Word) from Projectmanagertemplate.com is a professional-grade analytical tool designed to help you categorize and prioritize individuals based on two critical dimensions: Power (Influence) and Interest.

🛠️ High-Impact Visual Framework
Move away from "blanket communication" and toward surgical engagement. Our matrix helps you master the four essential quadrants of stakeholder management:

⚡ High Power / High Interest (Manage Closely): Your Key Players. Fully engage and satisfy Project Sponsors and senior executives.

⚖️ High Power / Low Interest (Keep Satisfied): The Influencers. Provide enough data to keep them happy without over-burdening them with day-to-day details.

📢 Low Power / High Interest (Keep Informed): The Ambassadors. Often end-users who provide feedback; keeping them informed prevents rumors and builds grassroots support.

🔍 Low Power / Low Interest (Monitor): The Observers. Require minimal effort, but should be monitored for shifts in power or interest.

